  "notes": [
    "Regular -ER verb formed with prefix *sobre-* + *vender* (to sell). All conjugations follow standard -ER endings.",
    "*El hotel sobrevendió sus habitaciones.* (The hotel oversold its rooms.)",
    "*La aerolínea sobrevende vuelos con frecuencia.* (The airline frequently overbooks flights.)",
    "Related: *vender* (to sell), *el sobrevendido* (overbooking situation), *el overbooking* (also used in Spanish)"
